From 1b5169ef8e31e3f1bf848d52ffc2e08f3c17068f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 13:37:59 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] perf(storage): share the committed reader's logic across
 backends (#797)

OnDiskReader<B> monomorphized every read per backend, although the tree,
cursor, dictionary and cache code below it already reads pages through
&dyn StorageBackend. Its generation metadata and reads move into a
non-generic ReaderCore held inline; the generic reader keeps only the
MutexStorageBackend<B> adapter and trait methods that pass it on. No
allocation, lock, cache or behavior change.

---
